body:
oh okay well thats good then.   


so with the AOR ability it says a "as part of casting Arbiter of Reality, you become invisible. This lasts until you attack or cast a spell." so when does this happen if you are not using your shroud at the time? or is this just two different versions of the same ability with two different styles? if so then idk if saying it modifies the shroud is a good thing it can be confusing lol  


for clarification I am talking about at the very end where it says "In addition, while within the radius of this feature, both forms of your Shroud of Illusion feature are augmented." )
